Scope and limits
----------------
This licence covers CFCR's own curation: the descriptions, curator notes, tags,
facet assignments, evidence-role judgements and vocabulary mappings.

It does not and cannot relicense:

  * Paper abstracts in literature/papers.yaml. These are reproduced from open
    metadata served by Crossref, Europe PMC and arXiv, and remain under their
    publishers' terms. CFCR stores no full text of paywalled work.
  * The resources being catalogued. Every model, dataset, protocol and database
    indexed here carries its own licence, recorded per record where it could be
    verified. Read it before use -- several entries are deliberately flagged
    because their licences are more restrictive than the repository they live
    in (model:nucleotide-transformer ships CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 weights, and
    model:alphagenome has API terms of use rather than a licence at all).
  * Ontology terms and identifiers, which carry the terms of their source
    ontologies (NCBITaxon, Cell Ontology, EFO).
